      "seed": 1433084150,
      "version": 1741,
      "versionNonce": 1507818431,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "MI6v10aKn62kFjYRP6AHb",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1763267422012,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. category\n- get data from ES\n- 25, with latest time.\n    \n- filter: location\n    - if explicity -> add \n\n- trending: \n    - trendRank\n\n1. trendRank + last 1 day \n2. latest in category.\n3. location.  \n\n\n\n2. recommendation\n-> Approach 1 -> using LLM vectoring embeddng and searching. \n\n-> Approach 2\n-> fetch userinterest\n    -> topKcategory\n    -> topksemantic\n    -> trendRank + 1 day\n    -> latest\n\n",
      "fontSize": 41.78863787705921,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. category\n- get data from ES\n- 25, with latest time.\n    \n- filter: location\n    - if explicity -> add \n\n- trending: \n    - trendRank\n\n1. trendRank + last 1 day \n2. latest in category.\n3. location.  \n\n\n\n2. recommendation\n-> Approach 1 -> using LLM vectoring embeddng and searching. \n\n-> Approach 2\n-> fetch userinterest\n    -> topKcategory\n    -> topksemantic\n    -> trendRank + 1 day\n    -> latest\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
