    {
      "id": "Oknd0gJ9NyZUrWsA4ldUH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 23312.565771633163,
      "y": -1406.4374775552317,
      "width": 3167.9990234375,
      "height": 990,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6j",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1646343953,
      "version": 1472,
      "versionNonce": 873980689,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763217179757,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. in a transactino ( also lock to other user during ths tx) ( timeout 5min ) \n    - check we have available room in that inventory table in OTA\n    - it will create entry with booking in our database \n    - reduce that inventory count in out local table\n    - if this fail no issue. \n    - if any oncurrency come they will see reduced count\n2. call the cm with that bookingId and details.( timeout 5min )  -> depending upon requests -> it can be async like orchestrator type of distributed transaction\n    - check we have available room in that inventory table in CM\n    - it will create entry with booking in our database \n    - reduce that inventory count in global table. \n    - if fail it will return the to OTA, it will revert. no issue only other user will not\n      see seats at that time.\n3. once receive success from 2, do ask for advance payment amount to pay immediately. \n    - call to payment service.\n    - if fail -> tell to CM that failed -> if that also failed -> in worst CM timer ends and revert counts.\n4. once receive from 3, \n5. send for success to cm about booking. \n    if fail ? -> this should be atleast on gaurantee -> we can do with outbox/kafka -> eventually udpate\n6. update in our db as well. \n\nIn worst all these -> is just that other user will not see the available room at that time.\n-> all CM and PSP should be idempotent.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. in a transactino ( also lock to other user during ths tx) ( timeout 5min ) \n    - check we have available room in that inventory table in OTA\n    - it will create entry with booking in our database \n    - reduce that inventory count in out local table\n    - if this fail no issue. \n    - if any oncurrency come they will see reduced count\n2. call the cm with that bookingId and details.( timeout 5min )  -> depending upon requests -> it can be async like orchestrator type of distributed transaction\n    - check we have available room in that inventory table in CM\n    - it will create entry with booking in our database \n    - reduce that inventory count in global table. \n    - if fail it will return the to OTA, it will revert. no issue only other user will not\n      see seats at that time.\n3. once receive success from 2, do ask for advance payment amount to pay immediately. \n    - call to payment service.\n    - if fail -> tell to CM that failed -> if that also failed -> in worst CM timer ends and revert counts.\n4. once receive from 3, \n5. send for success to cm about booking. \n    if fail ? -> this should be atleast on gaurantee -> we can do with outbox/kafka -> eventually udpate\n6. update in our db as well. \n\nIn worst all these -> is just that other user will not see the available room at that time.\n-> all CM and PSP should be idempotent.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
