      "text": "1. reservation -> db -> fail -> no issue. \n2. reservation -> CM -> 3 retry\n3. if fail -> revert our db. \n4. else if not get in sesison time -> again faile and if get after timeout return error to cm\n5. else get error within timeout -> revert\n6. else get success -> same do with payment. \n7. if fail -> revert CM ( ignore resopnse ) , revert db code.\n8. if part 2 or 3 fail in 7 -> after time out all will revert.\n9. if return -> timeout -> same -> also send for refund. and similary to 8 \n10. if return success in timerange -> update to channel manager -> must pass else -> refund user.\n11. if return success to CM -> update table and return success to UI. ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. reservation -> db -> fail -> no issue. \n2. reservation -> CM -> 3 retry\n3. if fail -> revert our db. \n4. else if not get in sesison time -> again faile and if get after timeout return error to cm\n5. else get error within timeout -> revert\n6. else get success -> same do with payment. \n7. if fail -> revert CM ( ignore resopnse ) , revert db code.\n8. if part 2 or 3 fail in 7 -> after time out all will revert.\n9. if return -> timeout -> same -> also send for refund. and similary to 8 \n10. if return success in timerange -> update to channel manager -> must pass else -> refund user.\n11. if return success to CM -> update table and return success to UI. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
