      "versionNonce": 840705073,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763217179758,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "protocol -> retry \nwhere atlesat one cae -> outbox + webhook\n\n2 approch\n\ncall cm first -> payment\nor payment -> cm.\n\neach has its pros and cons. \n\nbetter ? \n\n- after CM\n - if fail after CM -> not visible for other users.\n - what if during payment timeout happen ? might risk of double booking. \n\n- befor cm\n - if fail -> refund. ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "protocol -> retry \nwhere atlesat one cae -> outbox + webhook\n\n2 approch\n\ncall cm first -> payment\nor payment -> cm.\n\neach has its pros and cons. \n\nbetter ? \n\n- after CM\n - if fail after CM -> not visible for other users.\n - what if during payment timeout happen ? might risk of double booking. \n\n- befor cm\n - if fail -> refund. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
