      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rough NFR: \n1. News feed generation like twitter/instagram.\n2. Design twitter/instagram\n\njust do for 1 and 2 \n3. Design a system where Rippling's customers can upload\ndocuments for review by internal audit team. Each document\nhas a time to review complete. ->\nhttps://doniv.substack.com/p/rippling-system-design-\ninterview\n\n\nFR: \n- follow/unfollow\n- post -> text, image, video\n- feed of following. \n\nBonus: \n- like/comment. \n- recommendation feed. \n\n\nNFR: \n- high available. \n- consistency vs available -> feed => availability.\n- is this for specific country or multi country ??\n- scalable. \n- feed -> reverse chronological \n- feed latency ? -> \n- what about already seen post ? -> i think if have new ->\nshow -> else last one page of old post in reverse chrono.\n\nEstimations: \n- MAU -> 1B\n- DAU -> 350M\n- Per second -> 3.5k or ~4k\n- on avg open 5 times feed -> 20k / second feed generation.\n- peak -> 10x -> 200k qps. \n- post -> 1/day -> ~4k -> 40k/second.\n- max following ? -> ?  \n- max follower ? -> any\n\n\nEntities: \n- User, Post, UserFeed, Relation\n\nApi Design: \n- feed generation\n    - /api/v1/feed/       POST , x-token\n     Request: { requestMeta:{} , pageSize: <>, offset: <> }\n     Response: { pagesize: offset: posts:[{post1,\npost2...}]}     status x-trace-id\n\n- follow/unfollow\n   - api/v1/user/follow?id=\"\"\n   - api/v1/user/unfollow?id=\"\"\n- post\n    - /api/v1/post/\n   Request: {post}, Response: statuscode or post\n\nDb schema: \n- User\n    - Id \n- Relation                                         \n    - Id\n    - follower\n    - following\n\nor Id, follower: [follwings], going above since in case of\nunfollow/unfollow , might be problematic.\nwe can have pk on follower so no problem at get.\n- Post:\n    - Id\n    - userId \n- Feed:\n    - id\n    - userId \n    - list of posts in order ( upto 3-4 pages -> 100posts) ",
      "fontSize": 95.20672184732183,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Rough NFR: \n1. News feed generation like twitter/instagram.\n2. Design twitter/instagram\n\njust do for 1 and 2 \n3. Design a system where Rippling's customers can upload documents for review by internal audit team. Each document has a time to review complete. -> https://doniv.substack.com/p/rippling-system-design-interview\n\n\nFR: \n- follow/unfollow\n- post -> text, image, video\n- feed of following. \n\nBonus: \n- like/comment. \n- recommendation feed. \n\n\nNFR: \n- high available. \n- consistency vs available -> feed => availability.\n- is this for specific country or multi country ??\n- scalable. \n- feed -> reverse chronological \n- feed latency ? -> \n- what about already seen post ? -> i think if have new -> show -> else last one page of old post in reverse chrono.\n\nEstimations: \n- MAU -> 1B\n- DAU -> 350M\n- Per second -> 3.5k or ~4k\n- on avg open 5 times feed -> 20k / second feed generation.\n- peak -> 10x -> 200k qps. \n- post -> 1/day -> ~4k -> 40k/second.\n- max following ? -> ?  \n- max follower ? -> any\n\n\nEntities: \n- User, Post, UserFeed, Relation\n\nApi Design: \n- feed generation\n    - /api/v1/feed/       POST , x-token\n     Request: { requestMeta:{} , pageSize: <>, offset: <> }\n     Response: { pagesize: offset: posts:[{post1, post2...}]}     status x-trace-id\n\n- follow/unfollow\n   - api/v1/user/follow?id=\"\"\n   - api/v1/user/unfollow?id=\"\"\n- post\n    - /api/v1/post/\n   Request: {post}, Response: statuscode or post\n\nDb schema: \n- User\n    - Id \n- Relation                                         \n    - Id\n    - follower\n    - following\n\nor Id, follower: [follwings], going above since in case of unfollow/unfollow , might be problematic.\nwe can have pk on follower so no problem at get.\n- Post:\n    - Id\n    - userId \n- Feed:\n    - id\n    - userId \n    - list of posts in order ( upto 3-4 pages -> 100posts) ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
