      "index": "bBG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1358319615,
      "version": 887,
      "versionNonce": 1801289567,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763215596260,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Database\n- we don't need tx\nhere much. \n- operation at\nuserlevel\n- query is not very\ncomplex\n- a lots of data ,\nso scalable.\n- nosql ->\nhorizontally scaled\n-> dynamoDb -> less\ncomplex query\nrequired and\nhorizontally\nscalable.\n-> partiion ->\nuserid, postid,\nfollowerId\n-> sort key -> time\nstampe in postId\n- following in\nrelation",
      "fontSize": 69.1048620013697,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Database\n- we don't need tx here much. \n- operation at userlevel\n- query is not very complex\n- a lots of data , so scalable.\n- nosql -> horizontally scaled -> dynamoDb -> less complex query required and horizontally scalable.\n-> partiion -> userid, postid, followerId\n-> sort key -> time stampe in postId\n- following in relation",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
