    {
      "id": "vIiPLZf3Pa8SeGR6ZX8Ts",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12438.749198906093,
      "y": -8042.070861332206,
      "width": 979.7592058560414,
      "height": 328.73008310863094,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1776160721,
      "version": 418,
      "versionNonce": 259561151,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763259276513,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rough FR: \n\n3.  Design an event system like amplitude with analytics and reporting use cases.\n10. Design metrics system . \n11. Had to design and explain a Rollup-Aggregation system for events- \n    Given: \n        Client sdks that send events & Server that listens to events- \n    Requirements: - Optimized sent events using batching    \n                  - Handle failing requests using idempotency    \n                  - Use Rollup-Aggregation at server to store 15m, 1hr, 1day data\n7. Stock price rule notification -> https://www.paytmmoney.com/blog/how-we-built-an-in-\nhouse-price-alerts-system/\n",
      "fontSize": 20.22954357591575,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Rough FR: \n\n3.  Design an event system like amplitude with analytics and reporting use cases.\n10. Design metrics system . \n11. Had to design and explain a Rollup-Aggregation system for events- \n    Given: \n        Client sdks that send events & Server that listens to events- \n    Requirements: - Optimized sent events using batching    \n                  - Handle failing requests using idempotency    \n                  - Use Rollup-Aggregation at server to store 15m, 1hr, 1day data\n7. Stock price rule notification -> https://www.paytmmoney.com/blog/how-we-built-an-in-house-price-alerts-system/\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "I6HvW1QqeKGqXL9ktjvAq",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 12836.269483453067,
      "y": 3611.0073840602327,
      "width": 16711.6796875,
      "height": 10027.5390625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBs",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 292807953,
      "version": 459,
      "versionNonce": 1146211231,
