    {
      "id": "Q6typlMkO5TCAwEMV3jQw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 12430.799910307494,
      "y": -7288.298549677802,
      "width": 1616.999755859375,
      "height": 2520,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bBt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1025274865,
      "version": 1926,
      "versionNonce": 644035327,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763259276513,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design system like amplitude/rollup-aggregation \n\n\nFR: \n- our system should be able to send events from client at some activity.\n- customer should be able to see the multiple metric on these events. \n\nNFR: \n- exact information ? -> it would be tough from client. its ok if in very \n  rare case if misses -> lib/sdk.  ( we want fail client operation ?)\n- high scalable \n- metric ? -> real time ? yes -> unit scale -> 1min , also want to see 15min, 1h, 1day metrics. \n- mertic -> high available -> its ok in very rare case if data get bit late ( available >> consistency ) \n- what about 1min events -> user should be be able to see these in past as well ? usually don't allow,\n  let say 1min -> 1w, 15min -> 3mon, 1h-> 6mon, 1d -> 12months\n\nEstimations: \n- no of events ? -> \n- no of pages -> \n- on avg events/page/per/sec -> \n- Storage -> later on.\n\nEntities: \n- Event, AggregatedEvent\n\nApi Design: \n- publish event\n/api/v1/event       POST\nRequest: {Event}, Response: status code. \n\n- Get metrics\n/api/v1/metric/aggregated     POST\nRequest: { type: 15min, 1d, 1h, } , Response: [Event]\n\n- Get metrics in range\n/api/v1/metric/range?startTime=\"\" && endTime=\"\"  GET\nResponse: [Event]\n\nDb Schema:\nTopSongplayed\n\n\nEvent: \n{\n   event_name: \"\"\n   source: \"\"\n   songId: \"\"\n   property: { field1: value1, ....}\n   createdTimeStamp: \"\"\n   device: \"\"\n   ......\n}\n\n\nAggregatedEvent: \n{\n   event_name: \"\"\n   count: \"\"\n   songId: \"\"\n   aggregatedTimeStamp: \"\" // 15min agrregation\n   insertionTimestamp:\n}\n\n\nAggregatedEvent: \n{\n   event_name: \"\"\n   count: \"\"\n   songId: \"\"\n   aggregatedTimeStamp: \"\" // 1min agrregation\n   insertionTimestamp:\n}",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design system like amplitude/rollup-aggregation \n\n\nFR: \n- our system should be able to send events from client at some activity.\n- customer should be able to see the multiple metric on these events. \n\nNFR: \n- exact information ? -> it would be tough from client. its ok if in very \n  rare case if misses -> lib/sdk.  ( we want fail client operation ?)\n- high scalable \n- metric ? -> real time ? yes -> unit scale -> 1min , also want to see 15min, 1h, 1day metrics. \n- mertic -> high available -> its ok in very rare case if data get bit late ( available >> consistency ) \n- what about 1min events -> user should be be able to see these in past as well ? usually don't allow,\n  let say 1min -> 1w, 15min -> 3mon, 1h-> 6mon, 1d -> 12months\n\nEstimations: \n- no of events ? -> \n- no of pages -> \n- on avg events/page/per/sec -> \n- Storage -> later on.\n\nEntities: \n- Event, AggregatedEvent\n\nApi Design: \n- publish event\n/api/v1/event       POST\nRequest: {Event}, Response: status code. \n\n- Get metrics\n/api/v1/metric/aggregated     POST\nRequest: { type: 15min, 1d, 1h, } , Response: [Event]\n\n- Get metrics in range\n/api/v1/metric/range?startTime=\"\" && endTime=\"\"  GET\nResponse: [Event]\n\nDb Schema:\nTopSongplayed\n\n\nEvent: \n{\n   event_name: \"\"\n   source: \"\"\n   songId: \"\"\n   property: { field1: value1, ....}\n   createdTimeStamp: \"\"\n   device: \"\"\n   ......\n}\n\n\nAggregatedEvent: \n{\n   event_name: \"\"\n   count: \"\"\n   songId: \"\"\n   aggregatedTimeStamp: \"\" // 15min agrregation\n   insertionTimestamp:\n}\n\n\nAggregatedEvent: \n{\n   event_name: \"\"\n   count: \"\"\n   songId: \"\"\n   aggregatedTimeStamp: \"\" // 1min agrregation\n   insertionTimestamp:\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
