      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Choices: \n\n- only do 1min and publish\n- cronjob -> aggregate \n  1min -> 15min, 1h, 1day\n\nor batch processing, \n   from s3 -> OLAP like 1h or 1day\n\nabove -> lambda \n\nmodern industry using \nkappa -> batch and stream \nin single \n",
