      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763263268578,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "protocol \n-> too much events / s\n-> better to have continuous\nconnection\n-> websocket.\n-> stockId\n-> we can encode the evnets to reduce size. \n\nas per nfr -> can also group events using in memory queue.\nas per batching.\n",
      "fontSize": 31.70430458795891,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "protocol \n-> too much events / s\n-> better to have continuous\nconnection\n-> websocket.\n-> stockId\n-> we can encode the evnets to reduce size. \n\nas per nfr -> can also group events using in memory queue.\nas per batching.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
