      "originalText": "to improve\nwe can use cache \nor inmemory rules. \n\nlast notification of user: <timestamp>\n\nfor simple rules like threshold on current price. \n-> sorted set in redis. \n\nsorted set -> \ncurrent price\nopening price. \n\nmoving average. ??\n\n\n\n",
